<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equated to FOB Omaha Basis as of 3:00  PM and compared to Thursday's 3:00 PM close, fresh loins were firm;  butts mostly steady; sknd. hams steady; bellies $1.00-$2.00 higher;  lean trimmings $2.00 higher. Trading slow, with light demand and offerings.  -- USDA Market News.</p>
<p>Note: .5 ld. fresh jowls traded @ 35.00</p>
